<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circus Circus cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James said it downgraded Circus Circus Enterprises Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 5/8 to 21-7/16.</p>
</text>
